<item>
<title>追风者 EX5 PLUS / MAX 硬件分舱机箱上架，含定制液冷 1099 元起</title>
<description><p data-vmark="7a24">IT之家 9 月 3 日消息，Phanteks（追风者）现已在电商平台上架 EX5 PLUS / MAX 机箱。</p><p data-vmark="3def" style="text-align: center;"><img src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/070e4117-7893-48e6-9493-477bb27b4245.jpg" w="800" h="800" data-weibo="0" data-vmark="747b" class="no-alt-img"></p><p data-vmark="ff8a">其采用硬件分舱与模块化设计，<strong>主板、显卡、电源、处理器散热器各有独立散热舱室</strong>，主板舱与显卡舱侧透。这一结构可提升整机进风能力，减少对风扇的依赖。</p><p data-vmark="5c16">EX5 PLUS / MAX 支持 ATX 主板，<strong>扩展卡限长 258mm、限宽 93mm</strong>，电源限长 210mm，处理器散热器限高 72mm，具备 1 个 3.5" 盘位、1 个 2.5" 盘位，提供 USB-C 20Gbps 和 2 个 USB-A 5Gbps。</p><p data-vmark="4d35">这两个型号的机箱均<strong>配备定制 S25-360 ARGB 液冷</strong>，采用 90° 出管设计，原装连体 ARGB 风扇。EX5 MAX 额外集成一块内置 DRAM 的 6" IPS LCD 屏幕。</p><p data-vmark="4ed7" style="text-align: center;"><img src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/9/b3ed448e-e247-4d9d-a045-e9ef9b0fe7ad.jpg" w="800" h="700" data-weibo="1" data-vmark="111d" class="no-alt-img"></p><p data-vmark="7157">EX5 PLUS 定价 1099 元、EX5 MAX 定价 1699 元，<strong>9 月 8 日 00:00 开售</strong>。</p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://u.jd.com/xOIuTL3" target="_blank" data-wapurl="https://u.jd.com/xGwhf4L" data-iosurl="https://u.jd.com/xGIzDp3" data-androidurl="https://u.jd.com/xaIK82A" data-hosnexturl="https://u.jd.com/xGwmAib" data-hosurl="https://u.jd.com/x1ItUNJ" data-uwpurl="https://u.jd.com/xOIqo6y" data-wxmpurl="ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&amp;path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252fxgIsPgD%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.380" data-itwxurl="https://u.jd.com/xGIiSZt" data-lpwxurl="https://u.jd.com/xGIGPD1" data-ncid="230227"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img src="https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/510524/22/1909/107847/6a86d477F67a831c1/00833203200732c6.jpg" w="800" h="800"></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">京东</span><span class="card-name">追风者 EX5 PLUS 机箱</span></span><span class="card-abstract"></span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price"> 1099 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://u.jd.com/x1Ii1iV" target="_blank" data-wapurl="https://u.jd.com/xOIKMT6" data-iosurl="https://u.jd.com/x6whOLV" data-androidurl="https://u.jd.com/xOIqZDw" data-hosnexturl="https://u.jd.com/x6whkU4" data-hosurl="https://u.jd.com/xDIqBVm" data-uwpurl="https://u.jd.com/x1weJ8P" data-wxmpurl="ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&amp;path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252fxaIszuN%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.380" data-itwxurl="https://u.jd.com/xDIdqqC" data-lpwxurl="https://u.jd.com/xDIIgOl" data-ncid="230227"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img src="https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/496101/25/11615/98729/6a86d455F1fdae196/00833203207788f6.jpg" w="800" h="800"></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">京东</span><span class="card-name">追风者 EX5 MAX 机箱</span></span><span class="card-abstract"></span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price"> 1699 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir></description>
